### ========================================
### EUREKA SERVER - VERIFICATION
### ========================================

### 1. Vérifier Eureka Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8761
Accept: text/html

### 2. Eureka Apps (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

### ========================================
### API GATEWAY - HEALTH & ROUTES
### ========================================

### 3. Gateway Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 4. Gateway Routes
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/gateway/routes
Accept: application/json

### 5. Gateway Info
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### ========================================
### FORUM SERVICE - VIA GATEWAY
### ========================================

### 6. GET All Forums via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/forum
Accept: application/json

### 7. GET Forum by ID via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/forum/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. POST Create Forum via Gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forum
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Forum créé via Gateway",
  "description": "Test de création via API Gateway",
  "cree_par": 10,
  "niveau": "L1",
  "groupe": "GATEWAY-TEST",
  "cours": "Test Gateway",
  "statut": "OUVERT"
}

### 9. PUT Update Forum via Gateway
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/forum/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Forum modifié via Gateway",
  "description": "Modification via API Gateway",
  "niveau": "L3",
  "groupe": "INFO-A",
  "cours": "Développement Web",
  "statut": "OUVERT"
}

### 10. GET Messages via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/forum/1/messages
Accept: application/json

### 11. POST Message via Gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forum/message?forumId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contenu": "Message publié via API Gateway",
  "auteur_id": 999,
  "type_auteur": "ETUDIANT",
  "statut": "ACTIF"
}

### 12. GET Forums Plus Actifs via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/forum/plus-actifs
Accept: application/json

### 13. GET Recherche Forums via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/forum/recherche?titre=Java&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### ========================================
### RECRUTEMENT SERVICE - VIA GATEWAY
### ========================================

### 14. GET All Offres via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recrutement/offres
Accept: application/json

### 15. GET Offre by ID via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recrutement/offres/1
Accept: application/json

### 16. POST Create Offre via Gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recrutement/offres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Offre créée via Gateway",
  "description": "Test de création via API Gateway",
  "specialite": "Test Gateway",
  "experience_min": 2,
  "statut": "OUVERTE"
}

### 17. PUT Update Offre via Gateway
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/recrutement/offres/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Offre modifiée via Gateway",
  "description": "Modification via API Gateway",
  "specialite": "Développement Web",
  "experience_min": 5,
  "statut": "OUVERTE"
}

### 18. GET All Candidatures via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recrutement/candidatures
Accept: application/json

### 19. POST Postuler via Gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recrutement/candidatures?offreId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom_candidat": "Gateway",
  "prenom_candidat": "Test",
  "email": "gateway.test@example.com",
  "cv_url": "https://example.com/cv/gateway.pdf",
  "lettre_motivation": "Candidature soumise via API Gateway"
}

### 20. PATCH Accepter Candidature via Gateway
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/recrutement/candidatures/1/statut?statut=ACCEPTEE

### 21. GET Offres par Statut via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recrutement/offres/statut/OUVERTE
Accept: application/json

### ========================================
### COMPARAISON : DIRECT vs GATEWAY
### ========================================

### 22. Forum Direct (Sans Gateway)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/forum
Accept: application/json

### 23. Forum via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/forum
Accept: application/json

### 24. Recrutement Direct (Sans Gateway)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/recrutement/offres
Accept: application/json

### 25. Recrutement via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recrutement/offres
Accept: application/json

